=== desk_sniffer — AiP650E passive bus sniffer ===
CLK=GPIO18 (red)  DIO=GPIO4 (green)  CPU=240 MHz
Burst sampling at 4 MHz, 8000 samples per burst (2 ms).
Read-only. This firmware never drives the bus.

  r  toggle raw transaction dump
  s  print statistics
  c  reset statistics
  l  re-run the line identification check
  h  this help

  1 2 3 4   pulse that actuation channel for 300 ms
            and report which key the control box saw

Identifying lines (recording up to 2 s of traffic)...
  GPIO18 (expected CLK, red)  : 227 edges
  GPIO4 (expected DIO, green): 45 edges
  OK: both lines active, edge counts match the expected wiring.

Listening. Format:
  [time] S <byte><ack> <byte><ack> P | interpretation
  ack: 'a' = acknowledged (low), '-' = line high
  On key reads a '-' on the second byte is normal, not a fault.

